PTX MP+cas-lock
"A spin-free lock hand-off: P1's acquire CAS succeeds only on P0's release store of 1. Expected: forbidden."
{
x=0;
l=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0      | P1@cta 1,gpu 0                   ;
 st.weak x, 1        | atom.acquire.gpu.cas r0, l, 1, 2 ;
 st.release.gpu l, 1 | ld.weak r1, x                    ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
